    [24222]="Item Level 57\nBinds when equipped\nOne-Hand\nDagger\n47 - 88 Damage\nSpeed 1.80\n(37.50 damage per second)\n+8 Stamina\nDurability 65 / 65\nRequires Level 52\nEquip: +18 Attack Power.\nSell Price: 4 42 10",
    [206376]="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune:\nEach time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value.\nIn addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond (60 * 5). Lasts 15 sec.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",
    [206381]="Item Level 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your chest or robe with the Overload rune:\nGives your Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning spells a 30% chance to cast a second, similar spell on the same target at no additional cost that causes half damage and no threat.\n\"Learn a new ability after receiving Nature damage 10 times.\"\nAdded in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",
    [206382]="Item Level 10\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune:\nThe caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water. When a spell, melee, or ranged attack hits the caster or when one of the caster's spells gets a critical result, 2% of maximum mana is restored to the caster, expending one water globe. Only one globe will activate every few seconds. Lasts 10 min.\nOnly one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting 10 non-player enemies with 3 different elements (Nature, Frost, Fire).\"\nAdded in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",
    [206383]="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your pants with the Earth Shield rune:\nProtects the target with an earthen shield, reducing casting or channeling time lost when damaged by 30% and causing attacks to heal the shielded target for [28 * (29.888200 + 0.690312 * 60 + 0.136267 * 60 * 60) / 100]. This effect can only occur once every few seconds. 9 charges. Lasts 10 min. Earth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time.\n\"Learn a new ability after blocking 20 attacks with your shield.\"",
    [206384]="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",
    [206385]="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your pants with the Way of Earth rune:\nWhile Rockbiter Weapon is active on your main hand weapon and you have a shield equipped, you deal 65% increased threat, gain 30% increased health, take 10% reduced damage, gain 6% reduced chance to be critically hit by melee attacks, and Earth Shock taunts targets to attack you and has a separate cooldown from other Shock spells but has its range reduced to melee range. However, the range of your Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, Chain Heal, Healing Wave, and Lava Burst spells is reduced by 20 yards.\n\"Learn a new ability after defeating 20 enemies with Earth Shock.\"",
    [206386]="Item Level 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune:\nEach time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value.\nIn addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond (60 * 5). Lasts 15 sec.\n\"Learn a new ability after defeating enemies 10 times with Lightning Bolt.\"",
    [206387]="Item Level 25\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your gloves with the Lava Burst rune:\nYou hurl molten lava at the target, dealing 114 to 145 Fire damage. If your Flame Shock is on the target, Lava Burst deals 20% increased damage.\n\"Learn a new ability after taking damage from lava 5 times. (Reduces damage from some sources of lava)\"\nAdded in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",
    [206388]="Item Level 1\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nEngrave your gloves with the Molten Blast rune:\nBlast up to 10 enemies in a cone in front of you for [(7.583798 + 0.471881 * 60 + 0.036599 * 60 * 60) * 72 / 100 + 5 / 100 * Attack Power] to [(7.583798 + 0.471881 * 60 + 0.036599 * 60 * 60) * 108 / 100 + 5 / 100 * Attack Power] Fire damage. This ability generates a high amount of threat. Flame Shock periodic damage has a 10% chance to reset the cooldown on Molten Blast.\n\"Learn a new ability after defeating 10 enemies with Earth Shock.\"\nAdded in Season of Discovery. May not be in WoW: Forever.",
    [206389]="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your belt with the Fire Nova rune:\nYour Fire Nova Totem spell is replaced with Fire Nova, which causes your current Fire totem to emit damage at its location.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",
    [206390]="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune:\nThe caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water. When a spell, melee, or ranged attack hits the caster or when one of the caster's healing spells gets a critical result, 2% of maximum mana is restored to the caster, expending one water globe. Only one globe will activate every few seconds. Lasts 10 min.\nOnly one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",
    [206391]="Item Level 5\nBinds when picked up\nUnique\nRelic\nTotem\nClasses: Shaman\nRequires Level 3\nEngrave your bracers with the Riptide\nrune:\nHeals a friendly target for 486 to 534, an additional 445 over 15 sec, and increases the effectiveness of your Chain Heal casts directly on that target by 25%.\n\"Learn a new ability after hitting enemies 25 times with Rockbiter Weapon.\"",
